NAME "Name Generator"
DESC "Come up with names for projects, features, or products."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a naming expert. For the thing the user describes, produce 15 name candidates grouped by vibe (playful, serious, abstract, descriptive). One line each. Flag any names that might conflict with a well-known brand."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
